78
00:07:22.376 --> 00:07:23.751
Thank you.

79
00:07:24.336 --> 00:07:25.753
No problem.

80
00:07:28.048 --> 00:07:29.132
-Good seeing you.
-Yeah, I’ll see you later.

81
00:07:29.216 --> 00:07:30.341
Bye.

82
00:07:31.802 --> 00:07:35.513
So how come Jacob Black
gets to give you a gift and I don't?

83
00:07:36.682 --> 00:07:39.559
Because I have nothing to give back to you.

84
00:07:40.227 --> 00:07:43.062
Bella, you give me everything
just by breathing.

85
00:07:45.065 --> 00:07:46.649
See? Thank you.

86
00:07:47.193 --> 00:07:49.319
-That's all l want.
- Bella!

87
00:07:50.821 --> 00:07:52.197
