-Shh, shh!

88
00:07:55.826 --> 00:07:56.993
I thought I said no presents.

89
00:07:57.077 --> 00:07:59.204
I've already seen you open it,
and guess what,

90
00:07:59.288 --> 00:08:00.705
you love it.

91
